  "totalBlocks": 211,
  "translatedBlocks": 38,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80f921dc9023261e",
      "translationZh": "人工智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cae053c086768838",
      "translationZh": "保障 Amazon Quick 从 POC 到生产环境的安全：Agents、Flows 和 Spaces",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b69c1769e5b4785d",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 概念验证（POC）项目通常能在小规模试点团队中取得成功，但当安全与合规团队审查生产部署计划时，项目就会停滞。适用于十名试点用户的权限模型，在增加五个部门后往往就会失效。Agents 可能返回超出其预定范围的数据，而合规团队则难以审计数据集、Agents 与 Spaces 之间的关联方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a69f7f5006af53d",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 将仪表板、Chat Agents、Flows 和 Spaces 与知识库结合起来。每项功能都会引入标准仪表板控制措施无法覆盖的安全面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3c098a0803b14be",
      "translationZh": "本文以 AnyCompany 场景为例，逐步介绍如何设计 Dashboards、Spaces、知识库、Agents 和 Flows，并采用在用户和部门增加时仍然有效的安全控制措施。本指南涵盖四种模式：数据集塑形、智能体隔离、文档分类和审批关卡。此外，还包含一个治理框架和一份生产就绪检查清单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff320512134a6079",
      "translationZh": "以 AnyCompany 为例：5,000 名员工、5 个部门、5 个地点。三类受众需要以不同层级访问同一批数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2fcb1871b9fb45fe",
      "translationZh": "人力资源领导层：完整的员工数据，包括薪资和员工流失风险。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3c6bcb3bf1a3bfd",
      "translationZh": "部门经理：仅限其团队的运营指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6efe766c4570062d",
      "translationZh": "全体员工：公司政策和匿名化趋势。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed45078b074215ed",
      "translationZh": "将同一个数据集向这三类受众全部开放，并且仅依赖权限控制，会留下过多的配置错误空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f44846c9422d0f8",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案将一个源数据集塑造成三个与授权范围相匹配的视图，并将每个视图连接到一个专门构建的 Agent。它为每类受众发布相应的 Dashboard，按照内容归属界定 Spaces 的范围，并通过带有人工介入控制机制的 Flow 对出站操作进行把关。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29de374e7fe4112d",
      "translationZh": "以下截图展示了 HR Leadership Dashboard，该仪表板提供全体员工的完整人力状况视图，包括薪资、离职风险以及按职位划分的明细。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7316e77e5958f7b",
      "translationZh": "图 1a：HR Leadership Dashboard：提供全部 5,000 名员工的完整人力状况视图，包括薪资、离职风险以及按职位划分的明细。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9404bdc6284bc86d",
      "translationZh": "以下截图展示了 Department Manager Dashboard，该仪表板通过行级安全性将运营指标限定在单个部门内。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "104ee5564f6c0951",
      "translationZh": "图 1b：Department Manager Dashboard：使用相同的底层数据，但移除了敏感列并应用了 RLS。每位经理只能看到自己部门的员工。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "410ea25990a51493",
      "translationZh": "以下截图展示了 Company Trends Dashboard，该仪表板仅显示按部门和地点聚合的汇总信息。无法通过此视图访问任何员工个人记录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aad17b702f8b7631",
      "translationZh": "图 1c：公司趋势仪表板：数据聚合至部门 × 地点层级。不显示任何员工个人数据。所有员工均可访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba8f607428e05255",
      "translationZh": "创建并发布仪表板：要基于这些数据集创建仪表板，请依次进入 Analyses、选择 Create analysis，选择三个数据集之一，构建可视化图表，然后选择 Share，再选择 Publish dashboard。将每个仪表板共享给相应的群组。详细指导请参阅 Publishing dashboards。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf9b31f6bc7cb917",
      "translationZh": "本文展示了四种经过验证的模式，它们协同运作，通过数据架构落实安全保障：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98912ee2dd1ad4db",
      "translationZh": "在数据集层面移除敏感列，使其在结构上无法被访问",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e3b87e9927ddb43",
      "translationZh": "将每个 Agent 连接到且仅连接到一个数据集，该数据集的范围限定为其目标受众可访问的数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6c2fe2f3425668b",
      "translationZh": "将敏感文档排除在知识库之外，而不是依赖权限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4123b10bb3d5b0e",
      "translationZh": "要求在 Flow 中执行任何对外操作之前进行人工审核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00636e87e09514fe",
      "translationZh": "每种模式都在数据到达用户之前将其移除，而不是依赖权限设置来阻止访问。以下分步演示将实现全部四种模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc16d8517644d35f",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，请确保已准备好以下各项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd576195bf71788b",
      "translationZh": "一个已启用 Amazon Quick 的 AWS 账户（Enterprise 套餐）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4cd2bea80e99ef6",
      "translationZh": "至少三个代表不同角色类型的 Amazon Quick 用户账户（或一个可以切换角色的用户）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3886ae0b22a585a",
      "translationZh": "一个示例员工数据集（5,000 行，30 列）。使用下文步骤 1 中的生成步骤，或使用您自己的、具有类似列的 HR 数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ddd70270e2d6a3fa",
      "translationZh": "在您的账户中配置好 AWS CloudTrail 跟踪。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72515cf96123ce82",
      "translationZh": "如果您的 Flows 连接到外部系统，则需要具备 AWS Secrets Manager 访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22f8e7eafa9c797e",
      "translationZh": "注意：本演练使用 Amazon Quick 托管身份（非 IDC）。组创建和用户管理直接在 Amazon Quick 控制台中进行。如果您的账户使用 AWS IAM Identity Center（IDC）进行身份联合，则组管理在 AWS IAM Identity Center 控制台中处理，而不是在 Amazon Quick 内进行。安全模式（数据集整形、RLS、代理隔离）仍然适用，但组分配步骤会有所不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cf191538beaeeaf",
      "translationZh": "以下九个步骤将带您逐层了解该解决方案，从数据集整形和应用行级安全，到配置 Agents、Spaces、Flows 和审计日志记录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "64585827ce85d079",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：根据授权范围设计数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f814aa67d123e74",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 中，最重要的安全决策之一是如何设计数据集。数据集的列决定了连接到该数据集的任何人所能看到的信息上限。从结构上看，从数据集中移除列比通过权限隐藏列更为稳固。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b02f7827572f92e",
      "translationZh": "生成一个包含 5,000 行、30 列的合成员工数据集（员工 ID、性别、年龄、部门、岗位、职级、工作地点、年薪、敬业度评分、离职标志等）。使用五个部门（销售、工程、运营、财务、人力资源）、五个工作地点，以及符合实际情况的取值范围。配套的 GitHub 仓库包含完整的列清单和一个生成脚本示例，你也可以改用自己结构相似的人力资源数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3efe735f2eff275",
      "translationZh": "将生成的 employee_data.csv 上传到 Data（依次选择 Datasets、New dataset、Upload file），以创建三个数据集：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa46a94560710fe6",
      "translationZh": "已移除 4 个敏感列（年薪、奖金百分比、解雇日期、解雇原因）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0df084067e710a7f",
      "translationZh": "5,000（查询时通过 RLS 过滤）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
